  "question": {
    "text": "Consider an electron moving in the first Bohr orbit of a $\\mathrm{He}^{+}$ion with a velocity $\\mathrm{v}_1$. If it is allowed to move in the third Bohr orbit with a velocity $v_3$, then indicate the correct $v_3: v_1$ ratio",
    "image": null
  },
