  "solution": {
    "text": "$v=v_0 \\frac{z}{n}$\nFor 1st orbit of $\\mathrm{He}^{+} \\quad v_1=v_0 \\frac{2}{1}$ For $3^{\\text {rd }}$ orbit of $\\mathrm{He}^{+} \\quad v_3=v_0 \\frac{2}{3}$\n$v_3: v_1=1: 3$",
